; Seatbelt profile for the Claude subagent kill guard (bead inc-7zpw).
; A Bash command a SUBAGENT runs is wrapped in sandbox-exec with this profile.
; It allows a signal only to a process in the same sandbox, so a subagent
; cannot signal a process it did not start. The main session is not wrapped.
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny signal)
(allow signal (target same-sandbox))
